{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-pink-grenade","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Pink Grenade","description":"\u003cp\u003ePink Grenade S:ALT by Riot Squad - Perhaps the ultimate fruit soda e-liquid, Pink Grenade S:ALT by Riot Squad combines the flavours of lemon and strawberry with a sweet soda base to create a vape juice that you'll crave all day\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670482722871,"sku":"69d25e63091d2","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670482755639,"sku":"69d25e6394ced","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-salt-pink-grenade-vape-juice.jpg?v=1747700493","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-pink-grenade","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




